      <node id="prompt_aider_4_1" label="PROXY: example_messages = [&#xA;&#xA; dict(&#xA;&#xA; role=&quot;use">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="node_type" value="prompt"/>
          <attvalue for="rawSize" value="10"/>
          <attvalue for="prompt_type" value="PROXY"/>
          <attvalue for="prompt_text" value="example_messages = [&#xA;&#xA; dict(&#xA;&#xA; role=&quot;user&quot;,&#xA;&#xA; content=&quot;Change get_factorial() to use math.factorial&quot;,&#xA;&#xA; ),&#xA;&#xA; dict(&#xA;&#xA; role=&quot;assistant&quot;,&#xA;&#xA; content=&quot;&quot;&quot;To make this change we need to modify \mathweb/flask/app.py` to:&lt;br>&lt;br>1. Import the math package.&lt;br>2. Remove the existing factorial() function.&lt;br>3. Update get_factorial() to call math.factorial instead.&lt;br>&lt;br>Here are the SEARCH/REPLACE blocks:&lt;br>&lt;br>{fence[0]}python&lt;br>mathweb/flask/app.py&lt;br>import math&lt;br>from flask import Flask&lt;br>{fence[1]}&lt;br>&lt;br>{fence[0]}python&lt;br>mathweb/flask/app.py&lt;br>{fence[1]}&lt;br>&lt;br>{fence[0]}python&lt;br>mathweb/flask/app.py&lt;br> return str(math.factorial(n))&lt;br>{fence[1]}&lt;br>&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt; HEAD&lt;br>&quot;&quot;&quot;,&lt;br> ),&lt;br> dict(&lt;br> role=&quot;user&quot;,&lt;br> content=&quot;Refactor hello() into its own file.&quot;,&lt;br> ),&lt;br> dict(&lt;br> role=&quot;assistant&quot;,&lt;br> content=&quot;&quot;&quot;To make this change we need to modify `main.py` and make a new file `hello.py`:&lt;br>&lt;br>1. Make a new hello.py file with hello() in it.&lt;br>2. Remove hello() from main.py and replace it with an import.&lt;br>&lt;br>Here are the SEARCH/REPLACE blocks:&lt;br>&lt;br>{fence[0]}python&lt;br>hello.py&lt;br>&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt; SEARCH&lt;br>=======&lt;br>def hello():&lt;br> &quot;print a greeting&quot;&lt;br>&lt;br> print(&quot;hello&quot;)&lt;br>>>>>>>> REPLACE&lt;br>{fence[1]}&lt;br>&lt;br>{fence[0]}python&lt;br>main.py&lt;br>&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt; SEARCH&lt;br>def hello():&lt;br> &quot;print a greeting&quot;&lt;br>&lt;br> print(&quot;hello&quot;)&lt;br>=======&lt;br>from hello import hello&lt;br>>>>>>>> REPLACE&lt;br>{fence[1]}&lt;br>&quot;&quot;&quot;,&lt;br> ),&lt;br>]`"/>
          <attvalue for="prompt_url" value="https://github.com/Aider-AI/aider/blob/7afaa26f8b8b7b56146f0674d2a67e795b616b7c/aider/coders/editblock_fenced_prompts.py#L7"/>
